                <pb facs="0145" n="95" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg95"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby, chargé, to
                        Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic">July 24,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have received a telegram from the U. S. minister in Japan with reference to
                    taking Japanese citizens under the protection of the United States in case of
                    war. Chinese Government has given consent and asks the United States to protect
                    Chinese in Japan. A reply is requested.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
